.testdeps/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Credentials and private key material, regardless of subdirectory.
**/auth.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.secret
**/*.token

# Runtime/private state. Keep locally; never version account usage history.
artifacts/rainmeter-skin/@Resources/Usage.inc
artifacts/rainmeter-skin/@Resources/UsageHistory.jsonl
artifacts/rainmeter-skin/@Resources/UsageHistory.jsonl.state.json
artifacts/rainmeter-skin/@Resources/.FetchUsage.lock

# Archived live snapshots can contain private usage telemetry and are already
# preserved on disk in backups/. Source code is tracked separately.
backups/
backups/**/Usage.inc
backups/**/UsageHistory.jsonl
backups/**/UsageHistory.jsonl.state.json
backups/**/.FetchUsage.lock
runtime-snapshots/**/Usage.inc
runtime-snapshots/**/UsageHistory.jsonl

# Private conversation and engineering artifacts.
conversation/
docs/superpowers/
docs/07-conversation-summary-ko.md
docs/08-storage-manifest-ko.md
verification/

# Internal archive metadata and machine-specific verification report.
manifest.json
checksums/
docs/06-verification-report-ko.md
